\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 7. Evaluate retrieval before evaluating answers\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This is a step that is frequently missed in RAG projects.\
Suppose the correct information is in SEC chunk 127.\
Your retriever returns:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs26 \cf0 chunk 4\
chunk 32\
chunk 76\
chunk 91\
chunk 103\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 No prompt engineering in the world will repair that.\
So measure retrieval separately.\
Useful metrics include:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs26 \cf0 Recall@K\
Precision@K\
MRR\
Hit Rate\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 For example:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs26 \cf0 Question:\
"Why did margins decline?"\
\
Expected relevant chunk:\
SEC_127\
\
Retrieved:\
SEC_127\
NEWS_44\
SEC_130\
NEWS_76\
SEC_94\
\
Hit@5 = 1\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 This establishes whether 
\f1\b Chroma retrieval itself is working
\f0\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 8. Phase 4 \'97 DeepEval evaluation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Then evaluate the generated answer.\
Your stated objectives already give you a good starting set:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Faithfulness
\f0\b0 \
Does the answer make claims that are actually supported by the retrieved context?\

\f1\b Groundedness
\f0\b0 \
Is the answer based on supplied financial evidence rather than model knowledge?\

\f1\b Answer relevance
\f0\b0 \
Did it actually answer the broker's question?\

\f1\b Contextual relevance
\f0\b0 \
Did the retriever retrieve useful material?\

\f1\b Actionability
\f0\b0 \
Is the answer useful to a broker preparing for a client conversation?\
I'd also strongly consider a metric around 
\f1\b citation/source correctness
\f0\b0 .\
For financial RAG, a polished answer with the wrong supporting document is a serious failure.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

