\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 13. Add financial-specific guardrails\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Your final answering prompt should force several behaviors.\
The model should:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 use retrieved evidence rather than unsupported prior knowledge;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 distinguish 
\f1\b fact, inference, and market commentary
\f0\b0 ;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 identify dates because financial facts rapidly become stale;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 cite SEC/news sources;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 avoid inventing reasons for stock movements;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 say when evidence is insufficient;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 avoid interpreting correlation as causation;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 clearly identify calculations derived from price data;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 avoid presenting the system's output as personalized investment advice.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 This becomes particularly important for questions such as:\
\'93Why did Tesla fall 8%?\'94\
The correct answer might be:\
Tesla declined 8% during the period. The retrieved articles discuss weaker-than-expected deliveries and regulatory concerns, but the available evidence does not establish that either factor alone caused the decline.\
That's a much better financial RAG answer than:\
Tesla fell because deliveries were weak.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

