\cf0 The key principle throughout is 
\f1\b retrieval first, generation second, optimization third
\f0\b0 .\
One thing I would specifically avoid is starting with GEPA and asking it to improve your results. If retrieval is wrong, prompt optimization can actually obscure the underlying problem by producing increasingly convincing answers from inadequate evidence.\
Given the objective you've been given, your next concrete milestone should be 
\f1\b the baseline ingestion 
\f2\b0 \uc0\u8594 
